     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">ייתכן ולא הבנתי את השאלה.</div><div dir=\"rtl\">בעיקר הפתרון הוא לעשות את הדבר הבא:</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\">rnormal &lt;- function(n,mean=0,sd=1){</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\">        rnorm(n =n, mean = mean, sd = sd)      </div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\">}</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\">set.seed(2016)</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction:ltr\">rnormal(n=200,0,1)</div><div><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">האם זה עונה לשאלתך, או שפיספסתי פה משהו?</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>Contact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497544380000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cUBEpcyYUFVsWRCDPuqCS\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497544380000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jUdlaBUrxVAjn1cO5MFb4\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497544380000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uvXbU_xmGg3TqBHfp598e\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
